0.99 之上，MACD 柱僅微正。1 小時收盤 64,594.6 只略高於 MA60 64,590.9，且仍高於 MA20 64,338.2。這是短線偏弱、但支撐尚在的混合結構，不是已確認的破位。\n\n積極做空論若只抓住較大週期偏弱、5 分動能轉弱和模型略偏下，會誇大這些證據的方向性：本輪尚未收破 64,380.8，15 分與 1 小時均線仍提供反證，4 小時最新完整收線也高於 MA20。4 小時與 24 小時模型方向值分別約 0.457、0.487，預測幅度差異有限，24 小時驗證準確率約 50.3%；5 分、15 分、1 小時模型則已過期，不能拿來背書進場。反過來，保守觀望若把「訊號混合」當成永遠不交易的理由，也會忽略可檢驗的條件觸發：支撐收破且反抽失敗，或價格有效收復上方阻力，都能促使重新評估。支撐不是保證","time":"2026-11-18T17:03:28+08:00"}],"started_at":"2026-11-18T17:00:00+08:00","models":{"quick":{"provider":"openai","model":"gpt-6-luna","key":"OpenAI 槽位 5"},"deep":{"provider":"openai","model":"gpt-6-luna","key":"OpenAI 槽位 5"}},"done":10,"running_role":"aggressive","waiting":null,"resumed":false,"last_issue":null,"issues":[]},"paused":false,"host":{"label":"GCP","version":"1.0.115","heartbeat_at":"2026-11-18T17:03:31+08:00"},"frontend_revision":"8fc3790724a4d1a1","role_activity":{"neutral":{"at":"2026-11-18T17:03:28+08:00","elapsed_s":37.1,"source":"role"},"conservative":{"at":"2026-11-18T17:03:25+08:00","elapsed_s":34.3,"source":"role"},"trader":{"at":"2026-11-18T17:02:51+08:00","elapsed_s":18.8,"source":"role"},"manager":{"at":"2026-11-18T17:02:32+08:00","elapsed_s":22.8,"source":"role"},"bull":{"at":"2026-11-18T17:02:09+08:00","elapsed_s":62.0,"source":"role"},"bear":{"at":"2026-11-18T17:02:08+08:00","elapsed_s":60.8,"source":"role"},"onchain":{"at":"2026-11-18T17:01:07+08:00","elapsed_s":58.4,"source":"role"},"news":{"at":"2026-11-18T17:00:54+08:00","elapsed_s":45.4,"source":"role"},"sentiment":{"at":"2026-11-18T17:00:46+08:00","elapsed_s":37.3,"source":"role"},"pm":{"at":"2026-11-18T16:04:11+08:00","elapsed_s":37.0,"source":"role"},"aggressive":{"at":"2026-11-18T16:03:31+08:00","elapsed_s":35.6,"source":"role"},"market":{"at":"2026-11-18T09:00:32+00:00","elapsed_s":24.7,"source":"request"},"test-manager":{"at":"2026-11-18T09:00:33+00:00","elapsed_s":28.0,"source":"request"},"up-down-manager":{"at":"2026-11-18T09:03:17+00:00","elapsed_s":18.4,"source":"request"}},"publisher":{"active":true,"started_at"